dev-libs/openssl tls asm

# Networking
net-firewall/nftables doc

# System adminstration
app-admin/sysstat dcron

## Miscellaneous
media-libs/opencv contrib
media-libs/libsdl2 gles2
media-libs/nettle gmp
app-emulation/LookingGlass -pulseaudio pipewire
app-emulation/qemu usb spice ncurses nfs opengl pulseaudio usbredir virgl virtfs
