## Fonts
# fonts-meta is a bundle of many fonts.
media-fonts/fonts-meta emoji latin ms # cjk is in global USE flags
# nerd-fonts bundles all nerd fonts (may overlap with fonts-meta!).
media-fonts/nerd-fonts::gentoo-zh 3270 agave anonymouspro arimo aurulentsansmono bigblueterminal bitstreamverasansmono cascadiacode codenewroman comicshannsmono cousine daddytimemono dejavusansmono droidsansmono fantasquesansmono firacode firamono go-mono gohu hack hasklig heavydata hermit ia-writer ibmplexmono inconsolata inconsolatago inconsolatalgc iosevka iosevkaterm jetbrainsmono lekton liberationmono lilex meslo monofur monoid mononoki mplus nerdfontssymbolsonly noto opendyslexic overpass profont proggyclean robotomono sharetechmono sourcecodepro spacemono terminus tinos ubuntu ubuntumono victormono

## Nix package manager
#virtual/libcrypt static-libs
#sys-libs/libxcrypt static-libs
#dev-libs/boehm-gc cxx
#sys-apps/nix doc
#app-text/mdbook-lintcheck -flto # SEE: nix-guix-gentoo issue #29

## Japanese IME
app-i18n/mozc::gentoo-zh fcitx5 renderer -ibus

## Email
# NOTE: Simple Authentication and Security Layer (SASL) required for modern email>
# Pull in notmuch as a dependency instead of a world package.
mail-client/neomutt sasl notmuch

app-misc/abook nls # use mozilla nls for encryption

## Hyprland
# Add packages as wanted from github.com/hyprland-contrib.
gui-wm/hyprland-contrib -*

